open NumberField IsDedekindDomain Neutral.B1 Formalism.L2.Host Formalism.ConjugateSelfDual GlobalTheory.CuspRep UpperTheory.V UpperTheory.V.Af UpperTheory.V.Sd GlobalTheory.HilbertThetaSeries
